      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Executive Order 175, dated November 13, 2012, as amended by Executive Order 459, dated December 20, 2013, established a Mayor's Office of Housing Recovery Operations (\"the Office\" or \"HRO\") to implement recovery programs in the aftermath of Hurricane Sandy; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
