      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The Mayor's Office of Housing Recovery Operations is continued as an office within the Office of the Mayor, headed by a Director of Housing Recovery Operations. The Director will report to the Deputy Mayor for Housing and Economic Development.",
